{{Kunark Era}}
The Temple of Droga is a religious center for the goblins that have lived in these mountains for centuries. The Temple area is a vast underground complex connected to the Mines of Nurga. Respawn time is 20:30. Check out [[Droga Farming]] on a guide of efficient ways to farm this zone post-revamp.

